<title>SWEDEN: Volvo says to show a new model variant.</title>
<headline>Volvo says to show a new model variant.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Volvo Cars, a unit of Swedish automotive group AB Volvo, said on Friday it would show a picture of a new car based on an existing platform in the week of June 23.</p>
<p>&quot;We will present a picture of a variant of an existing platform after the midsummer holiday (June 20-22),&quot; Volvo Cars spokesman Ingmar Hesslefors told Reuters. &quot;The car will be launched this year.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
